                                                "sense_id": "804448d2-5b71-340e-b4db-dd5874b365cf",
                                                "text": "He pulled her again and her dress tore, the jigglies were right in front of him. He squeezed the jigglies, squeezed himself, got his trousers down as the two of them crashed backward through the palm trees into the middle of the room."
