                                                "sense_id": "804448d2-5b71-340e-b4db-dd5874b365cf",
                                                "text": "But it did go some way to explaining the curious passages of starry flesh and bone she kept seeing: Garbo’s throat on the woman, Victor Mature in this breast-obsessed male. / ‘Udders,’ he said. / ‘Jigglies,’ she countered. ‘Chi-chis. Kazooms –’ / Oh, she had a million."
                                            },
