                                                "sense_id": "804448d2-5b71-340e-b4db-dd5874b365cf",
                                                "text": "RUSTOM: (standing at the MODEL’s feet, staring down at her) All right, Miss Birthday Suit! Time to sing us a few party songs now – / TARUN: Don’t speak to her like that! / SWARUP: Don’t frighten her – / RUSTOM: (to the others) Ooof – a woman who’s willing to air her jigglies isn’t going to be frightened of a few questions!"
